p:24px;font-size:16px">A lot goes into bond valuations, as survivors of cor=
porate finance classes will be all too aware. Even in the current era of al=
gorithms, quants and electronic trading, they=E2=80=99re driven by human na=
ture and subject to the same tendency to overshoot that bedevils the stock =
market.</p><p style=3D"margin-top:24px;font-size:16px">But last week was so=
mething different. As one investment banker put it, the 10-year Treasury, t=
he most liquid long-term security on the planet, is =E2=80=9Ctrading like a=
 meme stock.=E2=80=9D This is its course over the five days with marks for =
